<BaseLayout title="About" description="Hotel feasibility executive at Hyatt; AI hobbyist in Hong Kong.">
  <section class="hero">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Singaporean on loan to Hong Kong. From hotel ops to pre-development and
      feasibility now — nothing beats the excitement of seeing a plot of land
      transform into a hotel. My sense of an area is governed by the hotel and
      its scale in that location; oddly, this comes with a genuinely bad sense
      of direction. Still a wanderluster, albeit not sure where's next. Off
      duty I meddle with small AI tools and automations, and try to make sense
      of everything.
    </p>
    <p class="lede">English · 中文 · ไทย · ລາວ</p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>The route so far</h2>
    <p class="city-note" style="margin-top: -0.5rem;">
      The wandering auditor's log — hover or tap a stop to open it.
    </p>
    <div class="cities">
      {cities.map((c, i) => (
        <div class:list={['stop', i === 0 && 'open']}>
          <button type="button" class="stop-head" aria-expanded={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}>
            {c.photos && c.photos.length > 0 && (
              <span class="medals">
                {c.photos.map((p) => (
                  <img class="medal" src={p.src} alt={p.alt} width="44" height="44" loading="lazy" />
                ))}
              </span>
            )}
            <span class="stop-name">{c.city}</span>
            <span class="period">{c.period}</span>
            <span class="chev" aria-hidden="true">▾</span>
          </button>
          <div class="stop-body">
            <div class="stop-inner">
              {c.roles.length > 0 && (
                <ul class="roles">
                  {c.roles.map((r) => <li>{r}</li>)}
                </ul>
              )}
              {c.stamps && (
                <p class="stamps">
                  {c.stamps.map((s) => (
                    <span class="stamp">
                      <img class="flag" src={`/flags/${s.code}.svg`} alt="" width="18" height="12" />
                      {s.name}
                    </span>
                  ))}
                </p>
              )}
              <p class="city-note">{c.note}</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>Where You Can Spot Me</h2>
    <ul class="wherenow">
      {wherenow.map((n) => (
        <li>
          <img class="flag" src={`/flags/${n.flag}.svg`} alt="" width="20" height="13" />
          <span class="chip-label">{n.label}</span><strong>{n.value}</strong>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ul>
    <p class="city-note">
      The four-city life isn't a lifestyle choice — it's a boarding pass collection.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section>
    <h2>The AI stack</h2>
    <ul class="aistack">
      {aiStack.map((row) => (
        <li>
          <span class="chip-label">{row.label}</span>
          <span class="stack-items">
            {row.items.map((t) => (
              <span class="stack-item">
                <img class="stack-logo" src={t.logo} alt="" width="18" height="18" loading="lazy" />
                {t.name}
              </span>
            ))}
